{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29172","headline":"甘露寺感事贻同志 · 许浑","name":"甘露寺感事贻同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云蔽长安路更赊，独随渔艇老天涯。\n青山尽日寻黄绢，沧海经年梦绦纱。\n雪愤有期心自壮，报恩无处髪先华。\n东堂旧侣勤书剑，同出膺门是一家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}